    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: lesson.compare_hint.1
    group: lesson.compare_hint
    speaker: 0
    dutch: We tellen ze allebei. Tel maar mee!
    english: Let's count them both. Count along!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 10890bfe133ced14a88539b61553dd02, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: lesson.same_amount.1
    group: lesson.same_amount
    speaker: 0
    dutch: Doe er net zoveel in de mand als er in het bakje liggen!
    english: Put just as many in the basket as there are in the tray!
    dutchClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5e2e69014e72944cb7f8ba5fef49d1f, type: 3}
    englishClip: {fileID: 0}
  - key: lesson.one_more.1
